{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \widctlpar \f4\fs20 {\f5\cf4 Commander:
\par 
\par A volcanic eruption is imminent and the lava flow will destroy our colony.  We must evacuate immediately.  All Evacuation Transports have been loaded to capacity and are ready to leave.
\par 
\par Computer projections have generated a list of the materials we need to survive.  Quickly gather the remaining vehicles and supplies and rendezvous at the mining beacon northwest of our colony.
\par 
\par Check the Specific Objectives for an exact list of what we need.
\par 
\par Hurry, Commander.  We don\rquote t have much time.
\par 
